==Strategy==
This is one of the most difficult of the Monthly Gauntlets. While it is possible to rush the early levels, it becomes nearly impossible around Lv. 15 due to the sheer strength of the Kroxos and Owlbrows.

Upgrade your wallet up until the Kroxos get halfway to the base then spawn [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] (note that a lvl 40 Can Can is needed for the higher levels) and spam [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] to stall, start spamming [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|regular Eraser]] as well when Bun Bun spawns. Keep up until Madonna gets near Bun Bun and both are near the base, then spawn an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] or other strong cat that has Area Attack and good damage to destroy the peons; bringing multiple can help speed up the process.  Continue spamming Erasers until Bun Bun and Madonna die.

